{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hype Me For Your Life!",
    "steam_appid": 2638070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your rhythm in a musical battle where the music decides your fate! Face the God of Time and capture souls to the beat of the music to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/fe48f84027ce281fb42fecbd9a2fca4b.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/fe48f84027ce281fb42fecbd9a2fca4b.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/fe48f84027ce281fb42fecbd9a2fca4b.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>UNIQUE RHYTHM MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each soul is a note falling on one of the 7 strings of your board. To capture them, you must press buttons with both hands as if you were playing real musical chords.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Hand</strong>: Selects the range of strings where you can capture souls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Hand</strong>: Chooses the exact string within the selected range and plays at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Challenge</strong>: Simultaneous notes and strategic combinations will put your skills to the test.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>USE MUSIC TO ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t attack your enemy directly\u2026 but you can make them drop their guard!<br>Capture notes in succession to build up your <strong>Hype Combo</strong>, and once you reach the max level, unleash a <strong>devastating attack</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the rhythm</strong> to break defenses and overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for epic boss fights</strong> with unique patterns and surprising mechanics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>INCREASING MUSICAL CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, chord combinations will become more complex, and you will face powerful bosses with unique and challenging mechanics. Can you overcome them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the note speed to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the mysterious protagonist with no memory, or choose between <strong>Bezto</strong>, the wise and friendly frog, and <strong>Arellys</strong>, a fierce fighter with a mighty hammer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this rhythmic experience and prove you have what it takes to conquer the music and save your soul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/34eaf67f5da5c406dd9ce36f8f4ac2a9.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/34eaf67f5da5c406dd9ce36f8f4ac2a9.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/34eaf67f5da5c406dd9ce36f8f4ac2a9.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/a7e800dc734768f6111f6d058197c32d.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/a7e800dc734768f6111f6d058197c32d.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/a7e800dc734768f6111f6d058197c32d.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/c174ba4111d73437cc65f196050f5f54.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/c174ba4111d73437cc65f196050f5f54.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/c174ba4111d73437cc65f196050f5f54.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your rhythm in a musical battle where the music decides your fate! Face the God of Time and capture souls to the beat of the music to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/fe48f84027ce281fb42fecbd9a2fca4b.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/fe48f84027ce281fb42fecbd9a2fca4b.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/fe48f84027ce281fb42fecbd9a2fca4b.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>UNIQUE RHYTHM MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each soul is a note falling on one of the 7 strings of your board. To capture them, you must press buttons with both hands as if you were playing real musical chords.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Hand</strong>: Selects the range of strings where you can capture souls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Hand</strong>: Chooses the exact string within the selected range and plays at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Challenge</strong>: Simultaneous notes and strategic combinations will put your skills to the test.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>USE MUSIC TO ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t attack your enemy directly\u2026 but you can make them drop their guard!<br>Capture notes in succession to build up your <strong>Hype Combo</strong>, and once you reach the max level, unleash a <strong>devastating attack</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the rhythm</strong> to break defenses and overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for epic boss fights</strong> with unique patterns and surprising mechanics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>INCREASING MUSICAL CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, chord combinations will become more complex, and you will face powerful bosses with unique and challenging mechanics. Can you overcome them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the note speed to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the mysterious protagonist with no memory, or choose between <strong>Bezto</strong>, the wise and friendly frog, and <strong>Arellys</strong>, a fierce fighter with a mighty hammer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this rhythmic experience and prove you have what it takes to conquer the music and save your soul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/34eaf67f5da5c406dd9ce36f8f4ac2a9.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/34eaf67f5da5c406dd9ce36f8f4ac2a9.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/34eaf67f5da5c406dd9ce36f8f4ac2a9.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/a7e800dc734768f6111f6d058197c32d.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/a7e800dc734768f6111f6d058197c32d.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/a7e800dc734768f6111f6d058197c32d.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/c174ba4111d73437cc65f196050f5f54.poster.avif?t=1740572926\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/c174ba4111d73437cc65f196050f5f54.webm?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638070/extras/c174ba4111d73437cc65f196050f5f54.mp4?t=1740572926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
